<h2 id="opportunities">PhD, internships &amp; collaborations</h2>
<p>I am open to <strong>research collaborations</strong> in document image analysis, historical and administrative documents, NLP on noisy OCR, geohistorical data, evaluation, and closely related topics. <strong>Prospective PhD students</strong> and <strong>interns</strong> (MSc / engineering school) should email a concise CV, a short academic transcript summary, and one paragraph describing research interests aligned with <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">our themes</a> and <a href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}">ongoing projects</a>. Funding and intake periods depend on calls and lab capacity; I will reply when your profile matches an open opportunity.</p>

